  ('13', 'blood - grouping reagents', '38', '3822', 'Note 1(g)', 'Heading 1302 applies, inter alia, to liquorice extract and extract of pyrethrum, extract of hops, extract of aloes and opium. The heading does not apply to: (a) liquorice extract containing more than 10% by weight of sucrose or put up as confectionery (heading 1704); (b) malt extract (heading 1901); (c) extracts of coffee, tea or mate (heading 2101); (d) vegetable saps or extracts constituting alcoholic beverages (Chapter 22); (e) camphor, glycyrrhizin or other products of heading 2914 or 2938; (f) concentrates of poppy straw containing not less than 50% by weight of alkaloids (heading 2939); (g) medicaments of heading 3003 or 3004 or blood - grouping reagents (heading 3882); (h) tanning or dyeing extracts (heading 3201 or 3203); (i) essential oils, concretes, absolutes,resinoids, extracted oleoresins, aqueous distillates or aqueous solutions of essential oils or preparations based on odoriferous substances of a kind used for the manufacture of beverages (Chapter 33); or (j) natural rubber, balata, gutta-percha, guayule, chicle or similar natural gums (heading 4001).'),
  ('13', 'tanning or dyeing extracts', '32', '3201', 'Note 1(h)', 'Heading 1302 applies, inter alia, to liquorice extract and extract of pyrethrum, extract of hops, extract of aloes and opium. The heading does not apply to: (a) liquorice extract containing more than 10% by weight of sucrose or put up as confectionery (heading 1704); (b) malt extract (heading 1901); (c) extracts of coffee, tea or mate (heading 2101); (d) vegetable saps or extracts constituting alcoholic beverages (Chapter 22); (e) camphor, glycyrrhizin or other products of heading 2914 or 2938; (f) concentrates of poppy straw containing not less than 50% by weight of alkaloids (heading 2939); (g) medicaments of heading 3003 or 3004 or blood - grouping reagents (heading 3882); (h) tanning or dyeing extracts (heading 3201 or 3203); (i) essential oils, concretes, absolutes,resinoids, extracted oleoresins, aqueous distillates or aqueous solutions of essential oils or preparations based on odoriferous substances of a kind used for the manufacture of beverages (Chapter 33); or (j) natural rubber, balata, gutta-percha, guayule, chicle or similar natural gums (heading 4001).'),
  ('13', 'dyeing extracts (heading 3203)', '32', '3203', 'Note 1(h)', 'Heading 1302 applies, inter alia, to liquorice extract and extract of pyrethrum, extract of hops, extract of aloes and opium. The heading does not apply to: (a) liquorice extract containing more than 10% by weight of sucrose or put up as confectionery (heading 1704); (b) malt extract (heading 1901); (c) extracts of coffee, tea or mate (heading 2101); (d) vegetable saps or extracts constituting alcoholic beverages (Chapter 22); (e) camphor, glycyrrhizin or other products of heading 2914 or 2938; (f) concentrates of poppy straw containing not less than 50% by weight of alkaloids (heading 2939); (g) medicaments of heading 3003 or 3004 or blood - grouping reagents (heading 3882); (h) tanning or dyeing extracts (heading 3201 or 3203); (i) essential oils, concretes, absolutes,resinoids, extracted oleoresins, aqueous distillates or aqueous solutions of essential oils or preparations based on odoriferous substances of a kind used for the manufacture of beverages (Chapter 33); or (j) natural rubber, balata, gutta-percha, guayule, chicle or similar natural gums (heading 4001).'),
  ('13', 'essential oils, concretes, absolutes, resinoids, extracted oleoresins, aqueous distillates or aqueous solutions of essential oils or preparations based on odoriferous substances of a kind used for the manufacture of beverages', '33', NULL, 'Note 1(i)', 'Heading 1302 applies, inter alia, to liquorice extract and extract of pyrethrum, extract of hops, extract of aloes and opium. The heading does not apply to: (a) liquorice extract containing more than 10% by weight of sucrose or put up as confectionery (heading 1704); (b) malt extract (heading 1901); (c) extracts of coffee, tea or mate (heading 2101); (d) vegetable saps or extracts constituting alcoholic beverages (Chapter 22); (e) camphor, glycyrrhizin or other products of heading 2914 or 2938; (f) concentrates of poppy straw containing not less than 50% by weight of alkaloids (heading 2939); (g) medicaments of heading 3003 or 3004 or blood - grouping reagents (heading 3882); (h) tanning or dyeing extracts (heading 3201 or 3203); (i) essential oils, concretes, absolutes,resinoids, extracted oleoresins, aqueous distillates or aqueous solutions of essential oils or preparations based on odoriferous substances of a kind used for the manufacture of beverages (Chapter 33); or (j) natural rubber, balata, gutta-percha, guayule, chicle or similar natural gums (heading 4001).'),
  ('13', 'natural rubber, balata, gutta-percha, guayule, chicle or similar natural gums', '40', '4001', 'Note 1(j)', 'Heading 1302 applies, inter alia, to liquorice extract and extract of pyrethrum, extract of hops, extract of aloes and opium. The heading does not apply to: (a) liquorice extract containing more than 10% by weight of sucrose or put up as confectionery (heading 1704); (b) malt extract (heading 1901); (c) extracts of coffee, tea or mate (heading 2101); (d) vegetable saps or extracts constituting alcoholic beverages (Chapter 22); (e) camphor, glycyrrhizin or other products of heading 2914 or 2938; (f) concentrates of poppy straw containing not less than 50% by weight of alkaloids (heading 2939); (g) medicaments of heading 3003 or 3004 or blood - grouping reagents (heading 3882); (h) tanning or dyeing extracts (heading 3201 or 3203); (i) essential oils, concretes, absolutes,resinoids, extracted oleoresins, aqueous distillates or aqueous solutions of essential oils or preparations based on odoriferous substances of a kind used for the manufacture of beverages (Chapter 33); or (j) natural rubber, balata, gutta-percha, guayule, chicle or similar natural gums (heading 4001).'),
  ('14', 'vegetable materials or fibres of vegetable materials of a kind used primarily in the manufacture of textiles, however prepared', NULL, NULL, 'Note 1', 'This Chapter does not cover the following products which are to be classified in Section XI: vegetable materials or fibres of vegetable materials of a kind used primarily in the manufacture of textiles, however prepared, or other vegetable materials which have undergone treatment so as to render them suitable for use only as textile materials.'),
  ('14', 'other vegetable materials which have undergone treatment so as to render them suitable for use only as textile materials', NULL, NULL, 'Note 1', 'This Chapter does not cover the following products which are to be classified in Section XI: vegetable materials or fibres of vegetable materials of a kind used primarily in the manufacture of textiles, however prepared, or other vegetable materials which have undergone treatment so as to render them suitable for use only as textile materials.'),
  ('14', 'chipwood', '44', '4404', 'Note 2', 'Heading 1401 applies, inter alia, to bamboos (whether or not split, sawn lengthwise, cut to length, rounded at the ends, bleached, rendered non-inflammable, polished or dyed), split osier, reeds and the like, to rattan cores and to drawn or split rattans. The heading does not apply to chipwood (heading 4404).'),
  ('14', 'wood wool', '44', '4405', 'Note 3', 'Heading 1404 does not apply to wood wool (heading 4405) and prepared knots or tufts for broom or brush making (heading 9603).'),
  ('14', 'prepared knots or tufts for broom or brush making', '96', '9603', 'Note 3', 'Heading 1404 does not apply to wood wool (heading 4405) and prepared knots or tufts for broom or brush making (heading 9603).'),
  ('15', 'pig fat or poultry fat of heading 0209', '02', '0209', 'Note 1 (a)', 'This Chapter does not cover : (a) pig fat or poultry fat of heading 0209; (b) cocoa butter, fat or oil (heading 1804); (c) edible preparations containing by weight more than 15% of the products of heading 0405 (generally Chapter 21); (d) greaves (heading 2301) or residues of headings 2304 to 2306; (e) fatty acids, prepared waxes, medicaments, paints, varnishes, soap, perfumery, cosmetic or toilet preparations, sulphonated oils or other goods of Section VI; or (f) factice derived from oils (heading 4002).'),
  ('15', 'cocoa butter, fat or oil', '18', '1804', 'Note 1 (b)', 'This Chapter does not cover : (a) pig fat or poultry fat of heading 0209; (b) cocoa butter, fat or oil (heading 1804); (c) edible preparations containing by weight more than 15% of the products of heading 0405 (generally Chapter 21); (d) greaves (heading 2301) or residues of headings 2304 to 2306; (e) fatty acids, prepared waxes, medicaments, paints, varnishes, soap, perfumery, cosmetic or toilet preparations, sulphonated oils or other goods of Section VI; or (f) factice derived from oils (heading 4002).'),
  ('15', 'edible preparations containing by weight more than 15% of the products of heading 0405', '21', NULL, 'Note 1 (c)', 'This Chapter does not cover : (a) pig fat or poultry fat of heading 0209; (b) cocoa butter, fat or oil (heading 1804); (c) edible preparations containing by weight more than 15% of the products of heading 0405 (generally Chapter 21); (d) greaves (heading 2301) or residues of headings 2304 to 2306; (e) fatty acids, prepared waxes, medicaments, paints, varnishes, soap, perfumery, cosmetic or toilet preparations, sulphonated oils or other goods of Section VI; or (f) factice derived from oils (heading 4002).'),
  ('15', 'greaves', '23', '2301', 'Note 1 (d)', 'This Chapter does not cover : (a) pig fat or poultry fat of heading 0209; (b) cocoa butter, fat or oil (heading 1804); (c) edible preparations containing by weight more than 15% of the products of heading 0405 (generally Chapter 21); (d) greaves (heading 2301) or residues of headings 2304 to 2306; (e) fatty acids, prepared waxes, medicaments, paints, varnishes, soap, perfumery, cosmetic or toilet preparations, sulphonated oils or other goods of Section VI; or (f) factice derived from oils (heading 4002).'),
  ('15', 'residues of headings 2304 to 2306', '23', NULL, 'Note 1 (d)', 'This Chapter does not cover : (a) pig fat or poultry fat of heading 0209; (b) cocoa butter, fat or oil (heading 1804); (c) edible preparations containing by weight more than 15% of the products of heading 0405 (generally Chapter 21); (d) greaves (heading 2301) or residues of headings 2304 to 2306; (e) fatty acids, prepared waxes, medicaments, paints, varnishes, soap, perfumery, cosmetic or toilet preparations, sulphonated oils or other goods of Section VI; or (f) factice derived from oils (heading 4002).'),
  ('15', 'fatty acids, prepared waxes, medicaments, paints, varnishes, soap, perfumery, cosmetic or toilet preparations, sulphonated oils or other goods of Section VI', NULL, NULL, 'Note 1 (e)', 'This Chapter does not cover : (a) pig fat or poultry fat of heading 0209; (b) cocoa butter, fat or oil (heading 1804); (c) edible preparations containing by weight more than 15% of the products of heading 0405 (generally Chapter 21); (d) greaves (heading 2301) or residues of headings 2304 to 2306; (e) fatty acids, prepared waxes, medicaments, paints, varnishes, soap, perfumery, cosmetic or toilet preparations, sulphonated oils or other goods of Section VI; or (f) factice derived from oils (heading 4002).'),
  ('15', 'factice derived from oils', '40', '4002', 'Note 1 (f)', 'This Chapter does not cover : (a) pig fat or poultry fat of heading 0209; (b) cocoa butter, fat or oil (heading 1804); (c) edible preparations containing by weight more than 15% of the products of heading 0405 (generally Chapter 21); (d) greaves (heading 2301) or residues of headings 2304 to 2306; (e) fatty acids, prepared waxes, medicaments, paints, varnishes, soap, perfumery, cosmetic or toilet preparations, sulphonated oils or other goods of Section VI; or (f) factice derived from oils (heading 4002).'),
  ('15', 'oils obtained from olives by solvent extraction', '15', '1510', 'Note 2', 'Heading 1509 does not apply to oils obtained from olives by solvent extraction (heading 1510).'),
  ('15', 'fats or oils or their fractions, merely denatured (excluded from heading 1518; classified in heading appropriate to the corresponding undenatured fats and oils and their fractions)', '15', NULL, 'Note 3', 'Heading 1518 does not cover fats or oils or their fractions, merely denatured, which are to be classified in the heading appropriate to the corresponding undenatured fats and oils and their fractions.'),
  ('15', 'Soap-stocks, oil foots and dregs, stearin pitch, glycerol pitch and wool grease residues', '15', '1522', 'Note 4', 'Soap-stocks, oil foots and dregs,stearin pitch, glycerol pitch and wool grease residuesfall in heading 1522.'),
  ('16', 'meat, meat offal, fish, crustaceans, molluscs or other aquatic invertebrates, as well as insects, prepared or preserved by the processes specified in Chapter 2', '02', NULL, 'Note 1', 'This Chapter does not cover meat, meat offal, fish, crustaceans, molluscs or other aquatic invertebrates, as well as insects, prepared or preserved by the processes specified in Chapter 2 or 3, Note 6 to Chapter 4 or in heading 0504.'),
