  ('16', 'meat, meat offal, fish, crustaceans, molluscs or other aquatic invertebrates, as well as insects, prepared or preserved by the processes specified in Note 6 to Chapter 4', '04', NULL, 'Note 1', 'This Chapter does not cover meat, meat offal, fish, crustaceans, molluscs or other aquatic invertebrates, as well as insects, prepared or preserved by the processes specified in Chapter 2 or 3, Note 6 to Chapter 4 or in heading 0504.'),
  ('16', 'meat, meat offal, fish, crustaceans, molluscs or other aquatic invertebrates, as well as insects, prepared or preserved by the processes specified in heading 0504', '05', '0504', 'Note 1', 'This Chapter does not cover meat, meat offal, fish, crustaceans, molluscs or other aquatic invertebrates, as well as insects, prepared or preserved by the processes specified in Chapter 2 or 3, Note 6 to Chapter 4 or in heading 0504.'),
  ('16', 'stuffed products of heading 1902 (provisions on food preparations containing more than 20% by weight of sausage/meat/meat offal/blood/insect/fish/crustaceans/molluscs/other aquatic invertebrates do not apply)', '19', '1902', 'Note 2', 'Food preparations fall in this Chapter provided that they contain more than 20% by weight of sausage, meat, meat offal, blood, insect, fish, crustaceans, molluscs or other aquatic invertebrates, or any combinationthereof. In cases where the preparation containstwo or more of the products mentioned above, it is classified in the heading of Chapter 16 corresponding to the component or components which predominate by weight.These provisions do not apply to the stuffed products of heading 1902 or to the preparations of heading 2103or 2104.'),
  ('16', 'preparations of heading 2103 (provisions on food preparations containing more than 20% by weight of sausage/meat/meat offal/blood/insect/fish/crustaceans/molluscs/other aquatic invertebrates do not apply)', '21', '2103', 'Note 2', 'Food preparations fall in this Chapter provided that they contain more than 20% by weight of sausage, meat, meat offal, blood, insect, fish, crustaceans, molluscs or other aquatic invertebrates, or any combinationthereof. In cases where the preparation containstwo or more of the products mentioned above, it is classified in the heading of Chapter 16 corresponding to the component or components which predominate by weight.These provisions do not apply to the stuffed products of heading 1902 or to the preparations of heading 2103or 2104.'),
  ('16', 'preparations of heading 2104 (provisions on food preparations containing more than 20% by weight of sausage/meat/meat offal/blood/insect/fish/crustaceans/molluscs/other aquatic invertebrates do not apply)', '21', '2104', 'Note 2', 'Food preparations fall in this Chapter provided that they contain more than 20% by weight of sausage, meat, meat offal, blood, insect, fish, crustaceans, molluscs or other aquatic invertebrates, or any combinationthereof. In cases where the preparation containstwo or more of the products mentioned above, it is classified in the heading of Chapter 16 corresponding to the component or components which predominate by weight.These provisions do not apply to the stuffed products of heading 1902 or to the preparations of heading 2103or 2104.'),
  ('17', 'Sugar confectionery containing cocoa', '18', '1806', 'Note 1(a)', 'This Chapter does not cover: (a) Sugar confectionery containing cocoa (heading 1806); (b) Chemically pure sugars (other than sucrose, lactose, maltose, glucose and fructose) or other products of heading 2940; or (c) Medicaments or other products of Chapter 30.'),
  ('17', 'Chemically pure sugars (other than sucrose, lactose, maltose, glucose and fructose) or other products of heading 2940', '29', '2940', 'Note 1(b)', 'This Chapter does not cover: (a) Sugar confectionery containing cocoa (heading 1806); (b) Chemically pure sugars (other than sucrose, lactose, maltose, glucose and fructose) or other products of heading 2940; or (c) Medicaments or other products of Chapter 30.'),
  ('17', 'Medicaments or other products of Chapter 30', '30', NULL, 'Note 1(c)', 'This Chapter does not cover: (a) Sugar confectionery containing cocoa (heading 1806); (b) Chemically pure sugars (other than sucrose, lactose, maltose, glucose and fructose) or other products of heading 2940; or (c) Medicaments or other products of Chapter 30.'),
  ('18', 'food preparations containing more than 20 % by weight of sausage, meat, meat offal, blood, insects, fish or crustaceans, molluscs or other aquatic invertebrates, or any combination thereof', '16', NULL, 'Note 1(a)', 'This Chapter does not cover: (a) food preparations containing more than 20 % by weight of sausage, meat, meat offal, blood, insects, fish or crustaceans, molluscs or other aquatic invertebrates, or any combination thereof (Chapter 16); (b) preparations of headings 0403, 1901, 1902, 1904, 1905, 2105, 2202, 2208, 3003 or 3004.'),
  ('18', 'preparations of heading 0403', '04', '0403', 'Note 1(b)', 'This Chapter does not cover: (a) food preparations containing more than 20 % by weight of sausage, meat, meat offal, blood, insects, fish or crustaceans, molluscs or other aquatic invertebrates, or any combination thereof (Chapter 16); (b) preparations of headings 0403, 1901, 1902, 1904, 1905, 2105, 2202, 2208, 3003 or 3004.'),
  ('18', 'preparations of heading 1901', '19', '1901', 'Note 1(b)', 'This Chapter does not cover: (a) food preparations containing more than 20 % by weight of sausage, meat, meat offal, blood, insects, fish or crustaceans, molluscs or other aquatic invertebrates, or any combination thereof (Chapter 16); (b) preparations of headings 0403, 1901, 1902, 1904, 1905, 2105, 2202, 2208, 3003 or 3004.'),
  ('18', 'preparations of heading 1902', '19', '1902', 'Note 1(b)', 'This Chapter does not cover: (a) food preparations containing more than 20 % by weight of sausage, meat, meat offal, blood, insects, fish or crustaceans, molluscs or other aquatic invertebrates, or any combination thereof (Chapter 16); (b) preparations of headings 0403, 1901, 1902, 1904, 1905, 2105, 2202, 2208, 3003 or 3004.'),
  ('18', 'preparations of heading 1904', '19', '1904', 'Note 1(b)', 'This Chapter does not cover: (a) food preparations containing more than 20 % by weight of sausage, meat, meat offal, blood, insects, fish or crustaceans, molluscs or other aquatic invertebrates, or any combination thereof (Chapter 16); (b) preparations of headings 0403, 1901, 1902, 1904, 1905, 2105, 2202, 2208, 3003 or 3004.'),
  ('18', 'preparations of heading 1905', '19', '1905', 'Note 1(b)', 'This Chapter does not cover: (a) food preparations containing more than 20 % by weight of sausage, meat, meat offal, blood, insects, fish or crustaceans, molluscs or other aquatic invertebrates, or any combination thereof (Chapter 16); (b) preparations of headings 0403, 1901, 1902, 1904, 1905, 2105, 2202, 2208, 3003 or 3004.'),
  ('18', 'preparations of heading 2105', '21', '2105', 'Note 1(b)', 'This Chapter does not cover: (a) food preparations containing more than 20 % by weight of sausage, meat, meat offal, blood, insects, fish or crustaceans, molluscs or other aquatic invertebrates, or any combination thereof (Chapter 16); (b) preparations of headings 0403, 1901, 1902, 1904, 1905, 2105, 2202, 2208, 3003 or 3004.'),
  ('18', 'preparations of heading 2202', '22', '2202', 'Note 1(b)', 'This Chapter does not cover: (a) food preparations containing more than 20 % by weight of sausage, meat, meat offal, blood, insects, fish or crustaceans, molluscs or other aquatic invertebrates, or any combination thereof (Chapter 16); (b) preparations of headings 0403, 1901, 1902, 1904, 1905, 2105, 2202, 2208, 3003 or 3004.'),
  ('18', 'preparations of heading 2208', '22', '2208', 'Note 1(b)', 'This Chapter does not cover: (a) food preparations containing more than 20 % by weight of sausage, meat, meat offal, blood, insects, fish or crustaceans, molluscs or other aquatic invertebrates, or any combination thereof (Chapter 16); (b) preparations of headings 0403, 1901, 1902, 1904, 1905, 2105, 2202, 2208, 3003 or 3004.'),
  ('18', 'preparations of heading 3003', '30', '3003', 'Note 1(b)', 'This Chapter does not cover: (a) food preparations containing more than 20 % by weight of sausage, meat, meat offal, blood, insects, fish or crustaceans, molluscs or other aquatic invertebrates, or any combination thereof (Chapter 16); (b) preparations of headings 0403, 1901, 1902, 1904, 1905, 2105, 2202, 2208, 3003 or 3004.'),
  ('18', 'preparations of heading 3004', '30', '3004', 'Note 1(b)', 'This Chapter does not cover: (a) food preparations containing more than 20 % by weight of sausage, meat, meat offal, blood, insects, fish or crustaceans, molluscs or other aquatic invertebrates, or any combination thereof (Chapter 16); (b) preparations of headings 0403, 1901, 1902, 1904, 1905, 2105, 2202, 2208, 3003 or 3004.'),
  ('19', 'food preparations containing more than 20% by weight of sausage, meat, meat offal, blood, insect, fish or crustaceans, molluscs or other aquatic invertebrates, or any combination thereof (except in the case of stuffed products of heading 1902)', '16', NULL, 'Note 1(a)', 'This Chapter does not cover : (a) except in the case of stuffed products of heading 1902, food preparations containing more than 20% by weight of sausage, meat, meat offal, blood, insect, fish or crustaceans, molluscs or other aquaticinvertebrates, or any combination thereof (Chapter 16)'),
  ('19', 'biscuits or other articles made from flour or from starch, specially prepared for use in animal feeding', '23', '2309', 'Note 1(b)', '(b) biscuits or other articles made from flour or from starch, specially prepared for use in animal feeding (heading 2309)'),
  ('19', 'medicaments or other products of Chapter 30', '30', NULL, 'Note 1(c)', '(c) medicaments or other products of Chapter 30.'),
  ('19', 'flour, meal or powder of dried vegetables (excluded from the heading 1901 definition of ''flour'' and ''meal'')', '07', '0712', 'Note 2(b)', 'For the purposes of heading 1901: ... (b) the terms ""flour"" and ""meal"" means : (1) cereal flour and meal of Chapter 11, and (2) flour, meal and powder of vegetable origin of any Chapter, other than flour, meal or powder of dried vegetables (heading 0712), of potatoes (heading 1105) or of dried leguminous vegetables (heading 1106).'),
  ('19', 'flour, meal or powder of potatoes (excluded from the heading 1901 definition of ''flour'' and ''meal'')', '11', '1105', 'Note 2(b)', 'For the purposes of heading 1901: ... (b) the terms ""flour"" and ""meal"" means : (1) cereal flour and meal of Chapter 11, and (2) flour, meal and powder of vegetable origin of any Chapter, other than flour, meal or powder of dried vegetables (heading 0712), of potatoes (heading 1105) or of dried leguminous vegetables (heading 1106).'),
  ('19', 'flour, meal or powder of dried leguminous vegetables (excluded from the heading 1901 definition of ''flour'' and ''meal'')', '11', '1106', 'Note 2(b)', 'For the purposes of heading 1901: ... (b) the terms ""flour"" and ""meal"" means : (1) cereal flour and meal of Chapter 11, and (2) flour, meal and powder of vegetable origin of any Chapter, other than flour, meal or powder of dried vegetables (heading 0712), of potatoes (heading 1105) or of dried leguminous vegetables (heading 1106).'),
  ('19', 'preparations containing more than 6% by weight of cocoa calculated on a totally defatted basis or completely coated with chocolate or other food preparations containing cocoa of heading 1806 (excluded from heading 1904)', '18', '1806', 'Note 3', 'Heading 1904 does not cover preparations containing more than 6% by weight of cocoa calculated on a totally defatted basis or completely coated with chocolate or other food preparations containing cocoa of heading 1806 (heading 1806).'),
  ('20', 'vegetables, fruit or nuts, prepared or preserved by the processes specified in Chapter 7, 8 or 11', '07', NULL, 'Note 1(a)', 'This Chapter does not cover : (a) vegetables, fruit or nuts, prepared or preserved by the processes specified in Chapter 7, 8 or 11; (b) vegetable fats and oils (Chapter 15); (c) food preparations containing more than 20% by weight of sausage, meat, meat offal, blood, insect, fish or crustaceans, molluscs or other aquatic invertebrates, or any combination thereof (Chapter 16); (d) bakers wares and other products of heading 1905; or (e) homogenised composite food preparations of heading 2104.'),
  ('20', 'vegetables, fruit or nuts, prepared or preserved by the processes specified in Chapter 7, 8 or 11', '08', NULL, 'Note 1(a)', 'This Chapter does not cover : (a) vegetables, fruit or nuts, prepared or preserved by the processes specified in Chapter 7, 8 or 11; (b) vegetable fats and oils (Chapter 15); (c) food preparations containing more than 20% by weight of sausage, meat, meat offal, blood, insect, fish or crustaceans, molluscs or other aquatic invertebrates, or any combination thereof (Chapter 16); (d) bakers wares and other products of heading 1905; or (e) homogenised composite food preparations of heading 2104.'),
  ('20', 'vegetables, fruit or nuts, prepared or preserved by the processes specified in Chapter 7, 8 or 11', '11', NULL, 'Note 1(a)', 'This Chapter does not cover : (a) vegetables, fruit or nuts, prepared or preserved by the processes specified in Chapter 7, 8 or 11; (b) vegetable fats and oils (Chapter 15); (c) food preparations containing more than 20% by weight of sausage, meat, meat offal, blood, insect, fish or crustaceans, molluscs or other aquatic invertebrates, or any combination thereof (Chapter 16); (d) bakers wares and other products of heading 1905; or (e) homogenised composite food preparations of heading 2104.'),
  ('20', 'vegetable fats and oils', '15', NULL, 'Note 1(b)', 'This Chapter does not cover : (a) vegetables, fruit or nuts, prepared or preserved by the processes specified in Chapter 7, 8 or 11; (b) vegetable fats and oils (Chapter 15); (c) food preparations containing more than 20% by weight of sausage, meat, meat offal, blood, insect, fish or crustaceans, molluscs or other aquatic invertebrates, or any combination thereof (Chapter 16); (d) bakers wares and other products of heading 1905; or (e) homogenised composite food preparations of heading 2104.'),
  ('20', 'food preparations containing more than 20% by weight of sausage, meat, meat offal, blood, insect, fish or crustaceans, molluscs or other aquatic invertebrates, or any combination thereof', '16', NULL, 'Note 1(c)', 'This Chapter does not cover : (a) vegetables, fruit or nuts, prepared or preserved by the processes specified in Chapter 7, 8 or 11; (b) vegetable fats and oils (Chapter 15); (c) food preparations containing more than 20% by weight of sausage, meat, meat offal, blood, insect, fish or crustaceans, molluscs or other aquatic invertebrates, or any combination thereof (Chapter 16); (d) bakers wares and other products of heading 1905; or (e) homogenised composite food preparations of heading 2104.'),
  ('20', 'bakers wares and other products of heading 1905', '19', '1905', 'Note 1(d)', 'This Chapter does not cover : (a) vegetables, fruit or nuts, prepared or preserved by the processes specified in Chapter 7, 8 or 11; (b) vegetable fats and oils (Chapter 15); (c) food preparations containing more than 20% by weight of sausage, meat, meat offal, blood, insect, fish or crustaceans, molluscs or other aquatic invertebrates, or any combination thereof (Chapter 16); (d) bakers wares and other products of heading 1905; or (e) homogenised composite food preparations of heading 2104.'),
  ('20', 'homogenised composite food preparations of heading 2104', '21', '2104', 'Note 1(e)', 'This Chapter does not cover : (a) vegetables, fruit or nuts, prepared or preserved by the processes specified in Chapter 7, 8 or 11; (b) vegetable fats and oils (Chapter 15); (c) food preparations containing more than 20% by weight of sausage, meat, meat offal, blood, insect, fish or crustaceans, molluscs or other aquatic invertebrates, or any combination thereof (Chapter 16); (d) bakers wares and other products of heading 1905; or (e) homogenised composite food preparations of heading 2104.'),
  ('20', 'fruit jellies, fruit pastes, sugar-coated almonds or the like in the form of sugar confectionery', '17', '1704', 'Note 2', 'Headings 2007 and 2008 do not apply to fruit jellies, fruit pastes, sugar-coated almonds or the like in the form of sugar confectionery (heading 1704) or chocolate confectionery (heading 1806).'),
  ('20', 'fruit jellies, fruit pastes, sugar-coated almonds or the like in the form of chocolate confectionery', '18', '1806', 'Note 2', 'Headings 2007 and 2008 do not apply to fruit jellies, fruit pastes, sugar-coated almonds or the like in the form of sugar confectionery (heading 1704) or chocolate confectionery (heading 1806).'),
  ('21', 'mixed vegetables', '07', '0712', '1(a)', 'This Chapter does not cover: (a) mixed vegetables of heading 0712'),
