  ('21', 'food preparations, other than the products described in heading 2103 or 2104, containing more than 20 % by weight of sausage, meat, meat offal, blood, insects, fish or crustaceans, molluscs or other aquatic invertebrates, or any combination thereof', '16', NULL, '1(e)', 'This Chapter does not cover: (e) food preparations, other than the products described in heading 2103 or 2104, containing more than 20 % by weight of sausage, meat, meat offal, blood, insects, fish or crustaceans, molluscs or other aquatic invertebrates, or any combination thereof (Chapter 16)'),
  ('21', 'products of heading 2404', '24', '2404', '1(f)', 'This Chapter does not cover: (f) products of heading 2404'),
