  ('30', 'peptides and proteins which are goods of heading 2937 (excluded from the heading 3002 definition of ''immunological products'')', '29', '2937', 'Note 2', 'For the purposes of heading 3002, the expression "immunological products" appliesto peptides and proteins (other than goods of heading 2937) which are directly involved in the regulation of immunological processes, such as monoclonal antibodies (MAB), antibody fragments, antibody conjugates and antibody fragment conjugates, interleukins, interferons (IFN), chemokines and certain tumor necrosis factors (TNF), growth factors(GF), hematopoietins and colony stimulating factors(CSF).;'),
  ('30', 'all goods of Chapter 28 or 29 (treated as ''unmixed products'' for purposes of headings 3003 and 3004 and Note 4(d))', '29', NULL, 'Note 3(a)(2)', 'For the purposes of headings 3003 and 3004 and of Note 4(d) to this Chapter, the following are to be treated: (a) as unmixed products: (1) unmixed products dissolved in water; (2) all goods of Chapter 28 or 29; and (3)simple vegetable extracts of heading1302,merelystandardised or dissolved in any solvent'),
  ('30', 'simple vegetable extracts of heading 1302, merely standardised or dissolved in any solvent (treated as ''unmixed products'' for purposes of headings 3003 and 3004)', '13', '1302', 'Note 3(a)(3)', 'For the purposes of headings 3003 and 3004 and of Note 4(d) to this Chapter, the following are to be treated: (a) as unmixed products: ... (3)simple vegetable extracts of heading1302,merelystandardised or dissolved in any solvent'),
  ('30', 'Goods (other than radioactive ores) answering to a description in heading 2844 or 2845 — must be classified in those headings and not elsewhere', '28', '2844', 'Section VI Note 1(A)', '(A) Goods (other than radioactive ores) answering to a description in heading 2844 or 2845 are to be classified in those headings and in no other heading of this Schedule.'),
