  ('31', 'optical elements of potassiumchloride', '90', '9001', 'Note 1(c)', 'optical elements of potassiumchloride (heading 9001)'),
  ('32', 'separate chemically defined elements or compounds (general exclusion, except those of heading 3203 or 3204, lumino-phores of heading 3206, fused-quartz/silica glass of heading 3207, and dyes and other colouring matter put up in forms or packings for retail sale of heading 3212)', NULL, NULL, 'Note 1(a)', 'This Chapter does not cover : (a) separate chemically defined elements or compounds [except those of heading 3203 or 3204, inorganic products of a kind used as lumino-phores (heading 3206), glass obtained from fused quartz or other fused silica in the forms provided for in heading 3207, and also dyes and other colouring matter put up in forms or packings for retail sale, of heading 3212]'),
  ('32', 'tannates or other tannin derivatives of products of headings 2936 to 2939, 2941 or 3501 to 3504', '29', '2936', 'Note 1(b)', '(b) tannates or other tannin derivatives of products of headings 2936 to 2939, 2941 or 3501 to 3504'),
  ('32', 'mastics of asphalt or other bituminous mastics', '27', '2715', 'Note 1(c)', '(c) mastics of asphalt or other bituminous mastics (heading 2715)'),
  ('32', 'pigments dispersed in non-aqueous media, in liquid or paste form, of a kind used in the manufacture of paints, including enamels (excluded from headings 3203, 3204, 3205 and 3206 by Note 3)', '32', '3212', 'Note 3', 'Headings 3203, 3204, 3205 and 3206 apply also to preparations based on colouringmatter... The headings do not apply, however, to pigments dispersed in non-aqueous media, in liquid or paste form, of a kind used in the manufacture of paints, including enamels (heading 3212), or to other preparations of heading 3207, 3208, 3209, 3210, 3212 or 3215.'),
  ('32', 'other preparations of heading 3207, 3208, 3209, 3210, 3212 or 3215 (excluded from headings 3203, 3204, 3205 and 3206 by Note 3)', '32', '3207', 'Note 3', 'Headings 3203, 3204, 3205 and 3206 apply also to preparations based on colouringmatter... The headings do not apply, however, to pigments dispersed in non-aqueous media, in liquid or paste form, of a kind used in the manufacture of paints, including enamels (heading 3212), or to other preparations of heading 3207, 3208, 3209, 3210, 3212 or 3215.'),
  ('32', 'products of a kind used as extenders in oil paints, whether or not they are also suitable for colouring distempers (excluded from the expression ''colouring matter'' in this Chapter)', NULL, NULL, 'Note 5', 'The expression "colouring matter" in this Chapter does not include products of a kind used as extenders in oil paints, whether or not they are also suitable for colouring distempers.'),
  ('32', 'Goods (other than radioactive ores) answering to a description in heading 2844 or 2845 — must be classified in those headings and not elsewhere', '28', '2844', 'Section VI Note 1(A)', '(A) Goods (other than radioactive ores) answering to a description in heading 2844 or 2845 are to be classified in those headings and in no other heading of this Schedule.'),
