  ('35', 'starch degradation products with a reducing sugar content exceeding 10% (i.e., products not meeting the ''dextrins'' definition for heading 3505)', '17', '1702', 'Note 2', 'For the purposes of heading 3505, the term "dextrins" means starch degradation products with a reducing sugar content, expressed as dextrose on the dry substance, not exceeding 10%. Such products with a reducing sugar content exceeding 10% fall in heading 1702.'),
  ('35', 'Goods (other than radioactive ores) answering to a description in heading 2844 or 2845 — must be classified in those headings and not elsewhere', '28', '2844', 'Section VI Note 1(A)', '(A) Goods (other than radioactive ores) answering to a description in heading 2844 or 2845 are to be classified in those headings and in no other heading of this Schedule.'),
