  ('35', 'Goods classifiable in heading 3004, 3005, 3006, 3212, 3303, 3304, 3305, 3306, 3307, 3506, 3707 or 3808 by reason of being put up in measured doses or for retail sale — classified in those headings only', '35', '3506', 'Section VI Note 2', 'Subject to Note 1 above, goods classifiable in heading 3004, 3005, 3006, 3212, 3303, 3304, 3305, 3306, 3307, 3506, 3707 or 3808 by reason of being put up in measured doses or for retail sale are to be classified in those headings and in no other heading of this Schedule.'),
  ('35', 'products described both in a Section VI heading by name or function and in heading 3827 — classified by name/function, not under 3827', '38', '3827', 'Section VI Note 4', 'Where a product answers to a description in one or more of the headings in Section VI by virtue of being described by name or function and also to heading 3827, then it is classifiable in a heading that references the product by name or function and not under heading 3827.'),
  ('36', 'separate chemically defined compounds, other than those described in Note 2(a) or 2(b) of Chapter 36', '29', NULL, 'Note 1', 'This Chapter does not cover separate chemically defined compounds other than those described in Note 2(a) or 2(b) below.'),
