  ('44', 'wood, in chips, in shavings, crushed, ground or powdered, of a kind used primarily in perfumery, in pharmacy, or for insecticidal, fungicidal or similar purposes (heading 1211)', '12', '1211', 'Note 1(a)', 'This Chapter does not cover: (a) wood, in chips,in shavings, crushed, ground or powdered, of a kind used primarily in perfumery, in pharmacy, orforinsecticidal,fungicidal orsimilar purposes(heading1211)'),
