  ('48', 'abrasive paper or paperboard (heading 6805)', '68', '6805', 'Note 2(m)', 'This Chapter does not cover: (m) abrasive paper or paperboard (heading 6805) or paper or paperboard-backed mica (heading 6814) (paper and paperboard coated with mica powder are, however, to be classified in this Chapter)'),
  ('48', 'paper or paperboard-backed mica (heading 6814)', '68', '6814', 'Note 2(m)', 'This Chapter does not cover: (m) abrasive paper or paperboard (heading 6805) or paper or paperboard-backed mica (heading 6814) (paper and paperboard coated with mica powder are, however, to be classified in this Chapter)'),
  ('48', 'metal foil backed with paper or paperboard (generally XIV or Section XV)', NULL, NULL, 'Note 2(n)', 'This Chapter does not cover: (n) metal foil backed with paper or paperboard (generally XIV or Section XV)'),
