  ('54', 'Synthetic or artificial filament tow of Chapter 55 (excluded from headings 5402 and 5403)', '55', NULL, 'Chapter 54 Note 2', 'Headings 5402 and 5403 do not apply to synthetic or artificial filament tow of Chapter 55.'),
  ('54', 'Strip and the like of heading 5404 or 5405 (not considered to be man-made fibres per Chapter 54 Note 1)', '54', '5404', 'Chapter 54 Note 1', 'Strip and the like of heading 5404 or 5405 are not considered to be man-made fibres.'),
  ('56', 'wadding, felt or nonwovens, impregnated, coated or covered with perfumes or cosmetics', '33', NULL, 'Note 1(a)', 'This Chapter does not cover: (a) wadding, felt or nonwovens, impregnated, coated or covered with substances or preparations (e.g., perfumes or cosmetics of Chapter 33, soaps or detergents of heading 3401, polishes, creams or similar preparations of heading 3405, fabric softeners of heading 3809) where the textile material is present merely as a carrying medium'),
  ('56', 'wadding, felt or nonwovens, impregnated, coated or covered with soaps or detergents', '34', '3401', 'Note 1(a)', 'This Chapter does not cover: (a) wadding, felt or nonwovens, impregnated, coated or covered with substances or preparations (e.g., perfumes or cosmetics of Chapter 33, soaps or detergents of heading 3401, polishes, creams or similar preparations of heading 3405, fabric softeners of heading 3809) where the textile material is present merely as a carrying medium'),
  ('56', 'wadding, felt or nonwovens, impregnated, coated or covered with polishes, creams or similar preparations', '34', '3405', 'Note 1(a)', 'This Chapter does not cover: (a) wadding, felt or nonwovens, impregnated, coated or covered with substances or preparations (e.g., perfumes or cosmetics of Chapter 33, soaps or detergents of heading 3401, polishes, creams or similar preparations of heading 3405, fabric softeners of heading 3809) where the textile material is present merely as a carrying medium'),
  ('56', 'wadding, felt or nonwovens, impregnated, coated or covered with fabric softeners', '38', '3809', 'Note 1(a)', 'This Chapter does not cover: (a) wadding, felt or nonwovens, impregnated, coated or covered with substances or preparations (e.g., perfumes or cosmetics of Chapter 33, soaps or detergents of heading 3401, polishes, creams or similar preparations of heading 3405, fabric softeners of heading 3809) where the textile material is present merely as a carrying medium'),
  ('56', 'textile products of heading 5811', '58', '5811', 'Note 1(b)', 'This Chapter does not cover: (b) textile products of heading 5811'),
  ('56', 'natural or artificial abrasive powder or grain, on a backing of felt or non wovens', '68', '6805', 'Note 1(c)', 'This Chapter does not cover: (c) natural or artificial abrasive powder or grain, on a backing of felt or non wovens (heading 6805)'),
  ('56', 'agglomerated or reconstituted mica, on a backing of felt or nonwovens', '68', '6814', 'Note 1(d)', 'This Chapter does not cover: (d) agglomerated or reconstituted mica, on a backing of felt or nonwovens (heading 6814)'),
  ('56', 'metal foil on a backing of felt or nonwovens', NULL, NULL, 'Note 1(e)', 'This Chapter does not cover: (e) metal foil on a backing of felt or nonwovens (generally Section XIV or XV).'),
  ('56', 'Sanitary towels (pads) and tampons, napkins and napkin liners and similar articles', '96', '9619', 'Note 1(f)', 'This Chapter does not cover: (f) Sanitary towels (pads) and tampons, napkins and napkin liners and similar articles of heading 9619.'),
  ('56', 'felt impregnated, coated, covered or laminated with plastics or rubber, containing 50 per cent. or less by weight of textile material', '39', NULL, 'Note 3(a)', 'Headings 5602 and 5603 do not, however, cover: (a) felt impregnated, coated, covered or laminated with plastics or rubber, containing 50 per cent. or less by weight of textile material or felt completely embedded in plastics or rubber (Chapter 39 or 40)'),
  ('56', 'felt completely embedded in plastics or rubber', '40', NULL, 'Note 3(a)', 'Headings 5602 and 5603 do not, however, cover: (a) felt impregnated, coated, covered or laminated with plastics or rubber, containing 50 per cent. or less by weight of textile material or felt completely embedded in plastics or rubber (Chapter 39 or 40)'),
  ('56', 'nonwovens completely embedded in plastics or rubber, or entirely coated or covered on both sides with such materials (visible to naked eye)', '39', NULL, 'Note 3(b)', 'Headings 5602 and 5603 do not, however, cover: (b) nonwovens, either completely embedded in plastics or rubber, or entirely coated or covered on both sides with such materials, provided that such coating or covering can be seen with the naked eye with no account being taken of any resulting change of colour (Chapter 39 or 40)'),
  ('56', 'nonwovens completely embedded in plastics or rubber, or entirely coated or covered on both sides with such materials (visible to naked eye)', '40', NULL, 'Note 3(b)', 'Headings 5602 and 5603 do not, however, cover: (b) nonwovens, either completely embedded in plastics or rubber, or entirely coated or covered on both sides with such materials, provided that such coating or covering can be seen with the naked eye with no account being taken of any resulting change of colour (Chapter 39 or 40)'),
  ('56', 'plates, sheets or strip of cellular plastics or cellular rubber combined with felt or non wovens, where the textile material is present merely for reinforcing purposes', '39', NULL, 'Note 3(c)', 'Headings 5602 and 5603 do not, however, cover: (c) plates, sheets or strip of cellular plastics or cellular rubber combined with felt or non wovens, where the textile material is present merely for reinforcing purposes (Chapter 39 or 40).'),
  ('56', 'plates, sheets or strip of cellular plastics or cellular rubber combined with felt or non wovens, where the textile material is present merely for reinforcing purposes', '40', NULL, 'Note 3(c)', 'Headings 5602 and 5603 do not, however, cover: (c) plates, sheets or strip of cellular plastics or cellular rubber combined with felt or non wovens, where the textile material is present merely for reinforcing purposes (Chapter 39 or 40).'),
  ('56', 'textile yarn, or strip or the like of heading 5404 or 5405, in which the impregnation, coating or covering cannot be seen with the naked eye (heading 5604 exclusion)', NULL, NULL, 'Note 4', 'Heading 5604 does not cover textile yarn, or strip or the like of heading 5404 or 5405, in which the impregnation, coating or covering cannot be seen with the naked eye (usually Chapters 50 to 55); for the purpose of this provision, no account should be taken of any resulting change of colour.'),
  ('57', 'floor covering underlays', NULL, NULL, 'Note 2', 'This Chapter does not cover floor covering underlays.'),
  ('58', 'textile fabrics referred to in Note 1 to Chapter 59, impregnated, coated, covered or laminated, or other goods of Chapter 59', '59', NULL, 'Chapter Note 1', 'This Chapter does not apply to textile fabrics referred to in Note 1 to Chapter 59, impregnated, coated, covered or laminated, or to other goods of Chapter 59.'),
  ('58', 'knotted net fabrics of twine, cordage or rope (excluded from heading 5804)', '56', '5608', 'Chapter Note 4', 'Heading 5804 does not apply to knotted net fabrics of twine, cordage or rope, of heading 5608.'),
  ('58', 'needlework tapestry (excluded from heading 5810 ''embroidery'')', '58', '5805', 'Chapter Note 6', 'In heading 5810, the expression "embroidery" means, inter alia, embroidery with metal or glass thread on a visible ground of textile fabric, and sewn appliqu work of sequins, beads or ornamental motifs of textile or other materials. The heading does not apply to needlework tapestry (heading 5805).'),
  ('58', 'narrow woven fabrics with woven fringes — re-routed from heading 5806 to heading 5808', '58', '5808', 'Chapter Note 5', 'For the purposes of heading 5806, the expression ""narrow woven fabrics"" means: (a) woven fabrics of a width not exceeding 30 cm, whether woven as such or cut from widerpieces, provided with selvedges (woven, gummed or otherwise made) on both edges; (b) tubular woven fabrics of a flattened width not exceeding 30 cm; and (c) bias binding with folded edges, of a width when unfolded not exceeding 30 cm. Narrow woven fabrics with woven fringes are to be classified in heading 5808.'),
  ('59', 'fabrics in which the impregnation, coating or covering cannot be seen with the naked eye', '50', NULL, 'Chapter Note 2(a)(1)', 'Heading 5903 applies to: (a) textile fabrics, impregnated, coated, covered or laminated with plastics, ... other than: (1) fabrics in which the impregnation, coating or covering cannot be seen with the naked eye (usually Chapters 50 to 55, 58 or 60); for the purpose of this provision, no account should be taken of any resulting change of colour'),
  ('59', 'products which cannot, without fracturing, be bent manually around a cylinder of a diameter of 7 mm, at a temperature between 15oC and 30oC', '39', NULL, 'Chapter Note 2(a)(2)', 'Heading 5903 applies to: ... other than: (2) products which cannot, without fracturing, be bent manually around a cylinder of a diameter of 7 mm, at a temperature between 15oC and 30oC (usually Chapter 39)'),
  ('59', 'products in which the textile fabric is either completely embedded in plastics or entirely coated or covered on both sides with such material, provided that such coating or covering can be seen with the naked eye', '39', NULL, 'Chapter Note 2(a)(3)', 'Heading 5903 applies to: ... other than: (3) products in which the textile fabric is either completely embedded in plastics or entirely coated or covered on both sides with such material, provided that such coating or covering can be seen with the naked eye with no account being taken of any resulting change of colour (Chapter 39)'),
  ('59', 'fabrics partially coated or partially covered with plastics and bearing designs resulting from these treatments', '50', NULL, 'Chapter Note 2(a)(4)', 'Heading 5903 applies to: ... other than: (4) fabrics partially coated or partially covered with plastics and bearing designs resulting from these treatments (usually Chapters 50 to 55, 58 or 60)'),
  ('59', 'plates, sheets or strip of cellular plastics, combined with textile fabric, where the textile fabric is present merely for reinforcing purposes', '39', NULL, 'Chapter Note 2(a)(5)', 'Heading 5903 applies to: ... other than: (5) plates, sheets or strip of cellular plastics, combined with textile fabric, where the textile fabric is present merely for reinforcing purposes (Chapter 39)'),
  ('59', 'textile products of heading 5811', '58', '5811', 'Chapter Note 2(a)(6)', 'Heading 5903 applies to: ... other than: (6) textile products of heading 5811'),
  ('59', 'fabrics made from yarn, strip or the like, impregnated, coated, covered or sheathed with plastics, of heading 5604', '56', '5604', 'Chapter Note 2(b)', 'Heading 5903 applies to: ... (b) fabrics made from yarn, strip or the like, impregnated, coated, covered or sheathed with plastics, of heading 5604.'),
  ('59', 'wall coverings consisting of textile flock or dust fixed directly on a backing of paper', '48', '4814', 'Chapter Note 4', 'This heading [5905] does not, however, apply to wall coverings consisting of textile flock or dust fixed directly on a backing of paper (heading 4814) or on a textile backing (generally heading 5907).'),
  ('59', 'wall coverings consisting of textile flock or dust fixed on a textile backing', '59', '5907', 'Chapter Note 4', 'This heading [5905] does not, however, apply to wall coverings consisting of textile flock or dust fixed directly on a backing of paper (heading 4814) or on a textile backing (generally heading 5907).'),
  ('59', 'plates, sheets or strip of cellular rubber combined with textile fabric, where the textile fabric is present merely for reinforcing purposes', '40', NULL, 'Chapter Note 5', 'This heading [5906] does not, however, apply to plates,sheets or strip of cellular rubber combined with textile fabric, where the textile fabric is present merely for reinforcing purposes (Chapter 40), or textile products of heading 5811.'),
  ('59', 'textile products of heading 5811 (in context of rubberised textile fabrics under heading 5906)', '58', '5811', 'Chapter Note 5', 'This heading [5906] does not, however, apply to plates,sheets or strip of cellular rubber combined with textile fabric, where the textile fabric is present merely for reinforcing purposes (Chapter 40), or textile products of heading 5811.'),
  ('59', 'fabrics in which impregnation, coating or covering cannot be seen with the naked eye', '50', NULL, 'Chapter Note 6(a)', 'Heading 5907 does not apply to: (a) fabrics in which impregnation, coating or covering cannot be seen with the naked eye (usually Chapters 50 to 55, 58 or 60)'),
  ('59', 'fabrics painted with designs (other than painted canvas being theatrical scenery, studio backcloths or the like)', NULL, NULL, 'Chapter Note 6(b)', 'Heading 5907 does not apply to: (b) fabrics painted with designs (other than painted canvas being theatrical scenery, studio backcloths or the like)'),
  ('59', 'fabrics partially covered with flock, dust, powdered cork or the like and bearing designs resulting from these treatments; however, imitation pile fabrics remain classified in this heading', NULL, NULL, 'Chapter Note 6(c)', 'Heading 5907 does not apply to: (c) fabrics partially covered with flock, dust, powdered cork or the like and bearing designs resulting from these treatments; however, imitation pile fabrics remain classified in this heading'),
  ('59', 'fabrics finished with normal dressings having a basis of amylaceous or similar substances', NULL, NULL, 'Chapter Note 6(d)', 'Heading 5907 does not apply to: (d) fabrics finished with normal dressings having a basis of amylaceous or similar substances'),
  ('59', 'wood veneered on a backing of textile fabrics', '44', '4408', 'Chapter Note 6(e)', 'Heading 5907 does not apply to: (e) wood veneered on a backing of textile fabrics (heading 4408)'),
  ('59', 'natural or artificial abrasive powder or grain, on a backing of textile fabrics', '68', '6805', 'Chapter Note 6(f)', 'Heading 5907 does not apply to: (f) natural or artificial abrasive powder or grain, on a backing of textile fabrics (heading 6805)'),
  ('59', 'agglomerated or reconstituted mica, on a backing of textile fabrics', '68', '6814', 'Chapter Note 6(g)', 'Heading 5907 does not apply to: (g) agglomerated or reconstituted mica, on a backing of textile fabrics (heading 6814)'),
  ('59', 'metal foil on a backing of textile fabrics', NULL, NULL, 'Chapter Note 6(h)', 'Heading 5907 does not apply to: (h) metal foil on a backing of textile fabrics (generally Section XIV or XV)'),
  ('59', 'transmission or conveyor belting, of textile material, of a thickness of less than 3 mm', NULL, NULL, 'Chapter Note 7(a)', 'Heading 5910 does not apply to: (a) transmission or conveyor belting, of textile material, of a thickness of less than 3 mm'),
  ('59', 'transmission or conveyor belts or belting of textile fabric impregnated, coated, covered or laminated with rubber or made from textile yarn or cord impregnated, coated, covered or sheathed with rubber', '40', '4010', 'Chapter Note 7(b)', 'Heading 5910 does not apply to: (b) transmission or conveyor belts or belting of textile fabric impregnated, coated, covered or laminated with rubber or made from textile yarn or cord impregnated, coated, covered or sheathed with rubber (heading 4010)'),
  ('60', 'crochet lace (lace) of heading 5804', '58', '5804', 'Chapter 60, Note 1(a)', 'This Chapter does not cover : (a) crochet lace of heading 5804 ; (b) labels, badges or similar articles, knitted or crocheted, of heading 5807 ; or (c) knitted or crocheted fabrics, impregnated, coated, covered or laminated, of Chapter 59. However, knitted or crocheted pile fabrics, impregnated, coated, covered or laminated, remain classified in heading 6001.'),
  ('60', 'labels, badges or similar articles, knitted or crocheted', '58', '5807', 'Chapter 60, Note 1(b)', 'This Chapter does not cover : (a) crochet lace of heading 5804 ; (b) labels, badges or similar articles, knitted or crocheted, of heading 5807 ; or (c) knitted or crocheted fabrics, impregnated, coated, covered or laminated, of Chapter 59. However, knitted or crocheted pile fabrics, impregnated, coated, covered or laminated, remain classified in heading 6001.'),
  ('60', 'knitted or crocheted fabrics, impregnated, coated, covered or laminated (other than pile fabrics, which remain in heading 6001)', '59', NULL, 'Chapter 60, Note 1(c)', 'This Chapter does not cover : (a) crochet lace of heading 5804 ; (b) labels, badges or similar articles, knitted or crocheted, of heading 5807 ; or (c) knitted or crocheted fabrics, impregnated, coated, covered or laminated, of Chapter 59. However, knitted or crocheted pile fabrics, impregnated, coated, covered or laminated, remain classified in heading 6001.'),
