  ('60', 'brushes, travel sets for sewing, slide fasteners, typewriter ribbons, sanitary towels (pads) and tampons, napkins (diapers) and napkin liners', '96', NULL, 'Section XI, Note 1(u)', '(u) Articles of Chapter 96 [for example, brushes, travelsetsforsewing,slide fasteners, typewriter ribbons, sanitary towels (pads) and tampons, napkins (diapers) and napkin liners]'),
  ('60', 'articles of Chapter 97 (works of art, collectors'' pieces, antiques)', '97', NULL, 'Section XI, Note 1(v)', '(v) articles of Chapter 97'),
  ('60', 'knitted/crocheted goods MADE UP within the meaning of Section XI Note 7 (cross-chapter boundary): Chapter 60 covers only knitted/crocheted FABRICS in the piece — once ''made up'' (cut to shape, hemmed, assembled, knitted-to-shape garments, household linen, etc.), the goods leave Chapter 60 for Chapters 61-63.', NULL, NULL, 'Section XI, Note 8(a) / Note 7', 'For the purposes of Chapters 50 to 60: (a) Chapters 50 to 55 and 60 and, except where the context otherwise requires, Chapters 56 to 59 do not apply to goods made up within the meaning of Note 7 above; and (b) Chapters 50 to 55 and 60 do not apply to goods of Chapters 56 to 59.'),
  ('60', 'knitted or crocheted APPAREL and clothing accessories — once made up, knitted garments fall in Chapter 61 (woven garments fall in Chapter 62).', '61', NULL, 'Section XI, Note 8(a) (implicit cross-reference) + Chapter 61, Note 1', 'Chapter 60 covers knitted or crocheted fabrics in the piece. Made-up knitted/crocheted articles of apparel and clothing accessories are classified in Chapter 61 per Chapter 61 Note 1 (''This Chapter applies only to made up knitted or crocheted articles'').'),
  ('60', 'knitted/crocheted made-up textile articles other than apparel (e.g., blankets, household linen, curtains) — fall in Chapter 63 (Other made up textile articles).', '63', NULL, 'Section XI, Note 8(a) (implicit cross-reference)', 'Once knitted/crocheted fabric is ''made up'' (Section XI Note 7) into household linen, blankets, curtains, etc., it leaves Chapter 60 for Chapter 63.'),
  ('61', 'goods of heading 6212 (e.g., brassieres, girdles, corsets, braces, suspenders, garters and similar articles and parts thereof, whether or not knitted or crocheted)', '62', '6212', 'Chapter 61, Note 2(a)', 'This Chapter does not cover: (a) goods of heading 6212; (b) worn clothing or other worn articles of heading 6309; or (c) orthopaedic appliances, surgical belts, trusses or the like (heading 9021).'),
  ('61', 'worn clothing or other worn articles', '63', '6309', 'Chapter 61, Note 2(b)', 'This Chapter does not cover: (a) goods of heading 6212; (b) worn clothing or other worn articles of heading 6309; or (c) orthopaedic appliances, surgical belts, trusses or the like (heading 9021).'),
  ('61', 'orthopaedic appliances, surgical belts, trusses or the like', '90', '9021', 'Chapter 61, Note 2(c)', 'This Chapter does not cover: (a) goods of heading 6212; (b) worn clothing or other worn articles of heading 6309; or (c) orthopaedic appliances, surgical belts, trusses or the like (heading 9021).'),
