  ('63', 'carpets (when worn) — excluded from heading 6309 ''furnishing articles''', '57', '5705', 'Note 3', 'Heading 6309 applies only to the following goods : (a) articles of textile materials : (i) clothing and clothing accessories, and parts thereof ; (ii) blankets and travelling rugs; (iii) bed linen, table linen, toilet linen and kitchen linen ; (iv) furnishing articles, other than carpets of headings 5701 to 5705 and tapestries of heading 5805. (b) footwear and headgear of any material other than asbestos. In order to be classified in this heading, the articles mentioned above must comply with both of the following requirements : (i) they must show signs of appreciable wear, and (ii) they must be presented in bulk or in bales, sacks or similar packings.'),
  ('63', 'tapestries (when worn) — excluded from heading 6309 ''furnishing articles''', '58', '5805', 'Note 3', 'Heading 6309 applies only to the following goods : (a) articles of textile materials : (i) clothing and clothing accessories, and parts thereof ; (ii) blankets and travelling rugs; (iii) bed linen, table linen, toilet linen and kitchen linen ; (iv) furnishing articles, other than carpets of headings 5701 to 5705 and tapestries of heading 5805. (b) footwear and headgear of any material other than asbestos. In order to be classified in this heading, the articles mentioned above must comply with both of the following requirements : (i) they must show signs of appreciable wear, and (ii) they must be presented in bulk or in bales, sacks or similar packings.'),
  ('63', 'footwear or headgear of asbestos (excluded from heading 6309)', '68', '6812', 'Note 3', 'Heading 6309 applies only to the following goods : (a) articles of textile materials : (i) clothing and clothing accessories, and parts thereof ; (ii) blankets and travelling rugs; (iii) bed linen, table linen, toilet linen and kitchen linen ; (iv) furnishing articles, other than carpets of headings 5701 to 5705 and tapestries of heading 5805. (b) footwear and headgear of any material other than asbestos. In order to be classified in this heading, the articles mentioned above must comply with both of the following requirements : (i) they must show signs of appreciable wear, and (ii) they must be presented in bulk or in bales, sacks or similar packings.'),
  ('65', 'worn headgear', '63', '6309', 'Note 1', 'This Chapter does not cover: (a) worn headgear of heading 6309; (b) asbestos headgear (heading 6812); or (c) dolls? hats, other toy hats or carnival articles of Chapter 95.'),
  ('65', 'asbestos headgear', '68', '6812', 'Note 1', 'This Chapter does not cover: (a) worn headgear of heading 6309; (b) asbestos headgear (heading 6812); or (c) dolls? hats, other toy hats or carnival articles of Chapter 95.'),
  ('65', 'dolls? hats, other toy hats or carnival articles', '95', NULL, 'Note 1', 'This Chapter does not cover: (a) worn headgear of heading 6309; (b) asbestos headgear (heading 6812); or (c) dolls? hats, other toy hats or carnival articles of Chapter 95.'),
  ('65', 'hat-shapes made by sewing, other than those obtained simply by sewing strips in spirals', NULL, NULL, 'Note 2', 'Heading 6502 does not cover hat-shapes made by sewing, other than those obtained simply by sewing strips in spirals.'),
  ('66', 'measure walking-sticks or the like', '90', '9017', 'Note 1', 'This Chapter does not cover: (a) measure walking-sticks or the like (heading 9017); (b) firearm-sticks, sword-sticks, loaded walking-sticks or the like (Chapter 93); or (c) goods of Chapter 95 (for example, toy umbrellas, toy sun umbrellas).'),
  ('66', 'firearm-sticks, sword-sticks, loaded walking-sticks or the like', '93', NULL, 'Note 1', 'This Chapter does not cover: (a) measure walking-sticks or the like (heading 9017); (b) firearm-sticks, sword-sticks, loaded walking-sticks or the like (Chapter 93); or (c) goods of Chapter 95 (for example, toy umbrellas, toy sun umbrellas).'),
  ('66', 'goods of Chapter 95 (for example, toy umbrellas, toy sun umbrellas)', '95', NULL, 'Note 1', 'This Chapter does not cover: (a) measure walking-sticks or the like (heading 9017); (b) firearm-sticks, sword-sticks, loaded walking-sticks or the like (Chapter 93); or (c) goods of Chapter 95 (for example, toy umbrellas, toy sun umbrellas).'),
  ('66', 'parts, trimmings or accessories of textile material, or covers, tassels, thongs, umbrella cases or the like, of any material (presented with but not fitted to articles of heading 6601 or 6602) — to be classified separately, not as parts of those articles', NULL, NULL, 'Note 2', 'Heading 6603 does not cover parts, trimmings or accessories of textile material, or covers, tassels, thongs, umbrella cases or the like, of any material. Such goods presented with, but not fitted to, articles of heading 6601 or 6602 are to be classified separately and are not to be treated as forming part of those articles.'),
  ('67', 'filtering or straining cloth of human hair', '59', '5911', 'Note 1', 'This Chapter does not cover : (a) filtering or straining cloth of human hair (heading 5911) ; (b) floral motifs of lace, of embroidery or other textile fabric (Section XI) ; (c) footwear (Chapter 64) ; (d) headgear or hair-nets (Chapter 65) ; (e) toys, sports requisites or carnival articles (Chapter 95) ; or (f) feather dusters, powder-puffs or hair sieves (Chapter 96).'),
  ('67', 'floral motifs of lace, of embroidery or other textile fabric', NULL, NULL, 'Note 1', 'This Chapter does not cover : (a) filtering or straining cloth of human hair (heading 5911) ; (b) floral motifs of lace, of embroidery or other textile fabric (Section XI) ; (c) footwear (Chapter 64) ; (d) headgear or hair-nets (Chapter 65) ; (e) toys, sports requisites or carnival articles (Chapter 95) ; or (f) feather dusters, powder-puffs or hair sieves (Chapter 96).'),
  ('67', 'footwear', '64', NULL, 'Note 1', 'This Chapter does not cover : (a) filtering or straining cloth of human hair (heading 5911) ; (b) floral motifs of lace, of embroidery or other textile fabric (Section XI) ; (c) footwear (Chapter 64) ; (d) headgear or hair-nets (Chapter 65) ; (e) toys, sports requisites or carnival articles (Chapter 95) ; or (f) feather dusters, powder-puffs or hair sieves (Chapter 96).'),
  ('67', 'headgear or hair-nets', '65', NULL, 'Note 1', 'This Chapter does not cover : (a) filtering or straining cloth of human hair (heading 5911) ; (b) floral motifs of lace, of embroidery or other textile fabric (Section XI) ; (c) footwear (Chapter 64) ; (d) headgear or hair-nets (Chapter 65) ; (e) toys, sports requisites or carnival articles (Chapter 95) ; or (f) feather dusters, powder-puffs or hair sieves (Chapter 96).'),
  ('67', 'toys, sports requisites or carnival articles', '95', NULL, 'Note 1', 'This Chapter does not cover : (a) filtering or straining cloth of human hair (heading 5911) ; (b) floral motifs of lace, of embroidery or other textile fabric (Section XI) ; (c) footwear (Chapter 64) ; (d) headgear or hair-nets (Chapter 65) ; (e) toys, sports requisites or carnival articles (Chapter 95) ; or (f) feather dusters, powder-puffs or hair sieves (Chapter 96).'),
  ('67', 'feather dusters, powder-puffs or hair sieves', '96', NULL, 'Note 1', 'This Chapter does not cover : (a) filtering or straining cloth of human hair (heading 5911) ; (b) floral motifs of lace, of embroidery or other textile fabric (Section XI) ; (c) footwear (Chapter 64) ; (d) headgear or hair-nets (Chapter 65) ; (e) toys, sports requisites or carnival articles (Chapter 95) ; or (f) feather dusters, powder-puffs or hair sieves (Chapter 96).'),
  ('67', 'articles in which feathers or down constitute only filling or padding (for example, bedding)', '94', '9404', 'Note 2', 'Heading 6701 does not cover : (a) articles in which feathers or down constitute only filling or padding (for example, bedding of heading 9404); (b) articles of apparel or clothing accessories in which feathers or down constitute no more than mere trimming or padding; or (c) artificial flowers or foliage or parts thereof or made up articles of heading 6702.'),
  ('67', 'articles of apparel or clothing accessories in which feathers or down constitute no more than mere trimming or padding', NULL, NULL, 'Note 2', 'Heading 6701 does not cover : (a) articles in which feathers or down constitute only filling or padding (for example, bedding of heading 9404); (b) articles of apparel or clothing accessories in which feathers or down constitute no more than mere trimming or padding; or (c) artificial flowers or foliage or parts thereof or made up articles of heading 6702.'),
  ('67', 'artificial flowers or foliage or parts thereof or made up articles', '67', '6702', 'Note 2', 'Heading 6701 does not cover : (a) articles in which feathers or down constitute only filling or padding (for example, bedding of heading 9404); (b) articles of apparel or clothing accessories in which feathers or down constitute no more than mere trimming or padding; or (c) artificial flowers or foliage or parts thereof or made up articles of heading 6702.'),
  ('67', 'articles of glass', '70', NULL, 'Note 3', 'Heading 6702 does not cover : (a) articles of glass (Chapter 70) ; (b) artificial flowers, foliage or fruit of pottery, stone, metal, wood or other materials, obtained in one piece by moulding, forging, carving, stamping or other process, or consisting of parts assembled otherwise than by binding, glueing, fitting into one another or similar methods.'),
  ('67', 'artificial flowers, foliage or fruit of pottery, stone, metal, wood or other materials, obtained in one piece by moulding, forging, carving, stamping or other process, or consisting of parts assembled otherwise than by binding, glueing, fitting into one another or similar methods', NULL, NULL, 'Note 3', 'Heading 6702 does not cover : (a) articles of glass (Chapter 70) ; (b) artificial flowers, foliage or fruit of pottery, stone, metal, wood or other materials, obtained in one piece by moulding, forging, carving, stamping or other process, or consisting of parts assembled otherwise than by binding, glueing, fitting into one another or similar methods.'),
