  ('87', 'Machines and working tools designed for fitting to tractors of heading 8701 as interchangeable equipment (even if presented with the tractor, and whether or not mounted on it)', NULL, NULL, 'Chapter Note 2', 'For the purposes of this Chapter, "tractors" means vehicles constructed essentially for hauling or pushing another vehicle, appliance or load, whether or not they contain subsidiary provision for the transport,in connection with the main use of the tractor, of tools, seeds, fertilizers or other goods. Machines and working tools designed for fitting to tractors of heading 8701 as interchangeable equipment remain classified in their respective headings even if presented with the tractor, and whether or not mountedon it.'),
