  ('87', 'Air-cushion vehicles designed to travel on a guide-track (hovertrains)', '86', NULL, 'Section Note 5(a)', 'Air-cushion vehicles are to be classified within this Section with the vehicles to which they are most akin as follows: (a) in Chapter 86 if designed to travel on a guide-track (hovertrains), (b) in Chapter 87 if designed to travel over land or over both land and water, (c) in Chapter 89 if designed to travel over water, whether or not able to land on beaches or landing - stages or also able to travel over ice. ...'),
