  ('89', 'Vehicles specially constructed to travel on both road and rail — classified under appropriate heading of Chapter 87 (not Ch.89)', '87', NULL, 'Section Note 4(a)', 'For the purposes of this Section: (a) vehiclesspecially constructed to travel on both road and rail are classified under the appropriate heading of Chapter 87, ...'),
