  ('89', 'Hovertrain track fixtures and fittings — classified as railway track fixtures and fittings (Chapter 86)', '86', NULL, 'Section Note 5', '... Hovertrain track fixtures and fittings are to be classified as railway track fixtures and fittings, and signalling, safety or traffic control equipment for hovertrain transport systems as signalling, safety or traffic control equipment for railways.'),
